<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Olin cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Olin cut to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Wednesday it had cut its rating on Olin Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the chemicals, metals and ammunition company closed Tuesday at 40-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
